      "rationale": "Version and build timestamp are baked into the JS bundle at build time via Vite defines (__APP_VERSION__, __BUILD_TIME__), ensuring they are always accurate for the deployed build with no runtime overhead or API calls."
    },
    {
      "id": "backlog_local_storage_cache",
      "label": "localStorage Caching Strategy",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "source_file": "BACKLOG.md",
      "source_location": "lines 106-109",
      "source_url": null,
      "captured_at": null,
      "author": null,
      "contributor": null,
      "rationale": "Auth token kept in sessionStorage (budget_auth) for security; offline auth cache goes to localStorage to survive browser close. Data cache key is budget_data_cache_${sheetId} to isolate per-spreadsheet. Queue items with retries > 3 are surfaced as failures rather than silently dropped."
    },
